=2 Preparation
>Temple of Uggalepih
!Temple of Uggalepih-map2-with-additional-markers.jpg||(Map 2)
* Unless you already got one, obtain a {@i:Doll Gizmo|1268} {i:Doll Gizmo|Doll Gizmo|1268} before starting this Mission.
** You can buy them from the **Auction House** under **Others** > **Misc. 1**.
** It's also a 100% drop from the {m:Manipulator} in {z:Temple of Uggalepih} Map 2 at (I-10)/(J-10) patrolling in the big room.
*** Proto-Waypoint is the closest warp.
*** The {p:Unity Concord} (Level 125) Warp is also a quick way to reach this NM. You will have to defeat the door guardian to get through the door to reach your target.
*** The Manipulator respawns every 15 minutes.

=2 Walkthrough
* Zone into {z:Fei'Yin} from {z:Beaucedine Glacier} for a cutscene.
** The {p:Unity Concord} (Level 125) Warp to Beaucedine Glacier is decently close.
* Head to {z:Fei'Yin} Map 2 at (H-7).
** If you are returning __after__ grabbing the {@i:Doll Gizmo|1268} {i:Doll Gizmo|Doll Gizmo|1268} it is faster to use the Fei'Yin HP #2 for the {z:Cloister of Frost} instead of navigating Map 1 to exit **A**.
* Trade the {@i:Doll Gizmo|1268} {i:Doll Gizmo|Doll Gizmo|1268} to the NPC {m:Talos} for a cutscene.
** This "NPC" is a pile of {m:Doll} Parts in front of a door when heading south down the hall (H-6) from the large room where {m:Capricious Cassie} spawns.
** The Talos for this mission does not show up on {p:Wide Scan}.
** The Talos will not be visible after completing the cutscene.
* After the cutscene, return to {z:Beaucedine Glacier} and interact with the **Point of Interest** next to **Mirror Pond** at (J-6 **SW corner**) for a cutscene.
** Subjob BLM and casting {s:Escape} puts you a short walk away from this position.
** Otherwise, from the Doll, you'll have to walk south to **A** to reach Map 1. From there, reach the exit at (F-11) to Beaucedine Glacier.
* Touch the **Point of Interest** again to begin a confrontation with **Slackjawed Mukdrom** (WAR)
** Has approximately 50k HP.
** Uses {p:Mighty Strikes} and has en-Drain on attacks.
*** Can use {p:Mighty Strikes} multiple times.
* Touch the **Point of Interest once** more for a cutscene after defeating the Orc.
* Return to {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} and click **Door:Prince Royal's RM** located at (H-7) for a final cutscene and your rewards.

